msgstr ""

#: flowing.tool.ToolEntry.resolve:25 of
msgid ""
"规范参数名 → JSON Schema property 的声明表， 取 ``tool.definition.params_schema`` "
"（覆写后的 LLM 视图不适用 ——本方法一律按注册表规范定义）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.tool.ToolEntry.resolve:28 of
msgid "规范名 → 值的完整参数字典，供 `Tool.__call__` 按 ``execute()`` 签名匹配分发。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.tool.ToolEntry.resolve:30 of
